---
description: After client-side edits, refresh SW hash cache and notify all clients
globs:
  - public/**/*.js
  - public/**/*.ts
  - public/**/*.css
  - public/**/*.html
  - public/**/*.json
  - public/**/*.jpeg
  - public/**/*.jpg
  - public/**/*.png
  - public/sw.js
  - public/dist/**/*.js
  - public/dist/**/*.css
alwaysApply: false
---

# Service Worker Notification After Client Edits

<rule>
name: sw_notify_after_client_edits
description: When making changes in the client-side codebase, always refresh the service worker hash cache and push an update notification so connected clients download the new assets.

actions:
  - type: suggest
    message: |
      Run after updating client-side code:
      `bash scripts/notify-service-worker-update.sh --restart`
</rule>

